# Terminology — {{TOPIC}}

Every acronym, coined term, evidence tag, and system name used across this corpus, defined
once. A document may assume these; nothing else.

## Evidence tags (kit-standard)

`[official]` authoritative/vendor statement — split *commitment* (Tier A) vs *mechanism*
(Tier B) per the kit's GRADING.md · `[measured]` measurement with data (`, replicated` /
`, single-source` / `, local`) · `[contested]` conflicting evidence · `[folklore]`
practitioner consensus without data · `[reported]` journalism/secondary coverage ·
`[E]` established in the cited source · `[I]` inference/synthesis by the pass author ·
**author-claimed / independently confirmed / disputed** — status words carried by every
number.

